<Information title="About" description="About information for Optimum Tech.">
<p>Optimum Tech helps businesses decide what to build, develop the software, and put it to work. We combine product thinking with hands-on engineering, drawing on experience building our own products and delivering client projects. Our work covers Elixir and Phoenix applications, AI features and the development workflows that support them.</p>
<p>Bring us an application that needs work, a feature you want to build, or a development process that keeps getting in the way. We can help define the scope, work on implementation and put useful checks around the result. Our public portfolio links to product-owned websites and source repositories. Archived projects are identified as such; their inclusion does not imply current maintenance.</p>
</Information>
